{"repositoryId":1292023799,"availability":"available","full":"openapi/gknowledge","name":"gknowledge","description":"🐧 A native GNOME knowledge workstation that turns documents into evolving AI-assisted knowledge bases.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":21,"forks":5,"created":"2026-07-07T08:42:57Z","updated":"2026-10-19T14:46:44Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://openapi.github.io/gknowledge","topics":["claude-ai","claude-code","codex","coding-agent","debian","gnome","gtk4","karpathy","knowledge-base","knowledge-management","libadwaita","llm","llm-wiki","local-first","markdown","mcp-server","obsidian","offline-first","ollama","ubuntu"],"demo":"https://openapi.github.io/gknowledge","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:32.008Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:32.008Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:32.008Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:05:32.008Z","stars":21,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English · 简体中文 · Italiano · Français · Português (BR) · Español","Drop in your documents. Get a linked wiki that an LLM keeps up to date.","A native GNOME app. Offline by default, plain Markdown on disk, Obsidian-compatible."],"features":["Native, not a web view. GTK 4 and Libadwaita, built to follow the GNOME HIG. No Electron, no Tauri, no browser engine.","Works with no account. A built-in heuristic engine ingests and answers offline. Add a model when you want better synthesis.","Your data stays yours. Markdown with YAML frontmatter plus a readable SQLite index. Open the folder in Obsidian or any editor.","Cited, reviewable, incremental. Every generated page records its sources, answers cite pages, and a review queue keeps you in control."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/openapi/gknowledge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a0da3e7e6e468193abe1744820fb261736ac71f754c29ec3c115eedcb8f0e717","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:32.080Z"},"overview